# .github/CODEOWNERS — Jade Capital Suite ownership rules
#
# Wave 10 slice 10.1 — single-owner repo at v1 readiness; explicit overrides
# document that sensitive surfaces are gated to the same owner until a
# co-maintainer is added.
#
# Format reference: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Order matters: the LAST matching pattern wins. Path-specific overrides
# therefore come AFTER the catch-all rule below.

# Default owner for everything in the repository.
# Keep this line first so subsequent overrides can narrow the surface.
*                                       @JesMedC

