# Highest blast-radius surface: a regression here is a security incident.
/src/2.Modules/Identity/                 @JesMedC

# Billing module — Stripe, ledger, decimal-only money paths.
/src/2.Modules/Billing/                  @JesMedC

# Infrastructure — Dockerfiles, nginx/Caddy, deploy runbooks, secrets adapter.
/infrastructure/                         @JesMedC

# CI/CD workflows — Dependabot + nightly scan + ci.yml + composite actions.
/.github/workflows/                      @JesMedC

